<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107057" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκ-δύομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, with aor. 2 and pf.
		
			Act.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slip out of,
				escape,</i> c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνους Τρωϊκοὺς ὑπεξέδυν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					347
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.170f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.384
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκδυόμενοι τὴν Στοάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Sto.Herc.</u>
					339.13
				</span></i>
			: also c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				9
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκδύς</span>”
				<i>having slipped out,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Arat.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκδέδυκα δεῦρ᾽ ἔξω λάθρᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Epit.</u>
					483
				</span></i>
			.—An 
				Act.
			
			impf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεξέδυνε</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				4.4
			</span></i>.</div>
